surface":"மகளி","parts":[{"text":"மகளி","lemma":"மகளி","gloss":"girls"}],"gloss":"girls","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ரோராங்","parts":[{"text":"ரோராங்","lemma":"ரோராங்","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"together","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காட்ட","parts":[{"text":"காட்ட","lemma":"காட்ட","gloss":"as they play"}],"gloss":"as they play","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாய்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"வாய்ந்த","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"caught"}],"gloss":"caught"},{"surface":"லவன்","parts":[{"text":"லவன்","lemma":"லவன்","gloss":"crab"}],"gloss":"crab","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துன்புறு","parts":[{"text":"துன்புறு","lemma":"துன்புறு","gloss":"suffering"}],"gloss":"suffering"},{"surface":"துனைபரி","parts":[{"text":"துனை","lemma":"துனை","gloss":"speed"},{"text":"பரி","lemma":"பரி","gloss":"run"}],"gloss":"fast pace"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஓங்குவரல்","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கு","lemma":"ஓங்கு","gloss":"rising"},{"text":"வரல்","lemma":"வருதல்","gloss":"coming"}],"gloss":"high-rising"},{"surface":"விரிதிரை","parts":[{"text":"விரி","lemma":"விரி","gloss":"expanding"},{"text":"திரை","lemma":"திரை","gloss":"wave"}],"gloss":"expanding waves"},{"surface":"களையும்","parts":[{"text":"களையும்","lemma":"களை","gloss":"dispels/removes"}],"gloss":"removes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துறைவன்","parts":[{"text":"துறைவன்","lemma":"துறைவன்","gloss":"lord of the shore"}],"gloss":"lord of the shore"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is he indeed?"},{"surface":"பிறவா","parts":[{"text":"பிறவா","lemma":"பிறவா","gloss":"other things"}],"gloss":"other things","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யினவே","parts":[{"text":"யினவே","lemma":"யினவே","gloss":"have become"}],"gloss":"have become","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Beautiful bangles to slip off, and faintness to take over my body, / if mother knows this distress filled with pain, / will I survive? May you live, my friend! Unceasingly / the mighty sea batters the shore of mingled sand, / where girls playing the ōrai game together / cause the caught crab to suffer, which then with fast pace / the high-rising expanding waves rescue. / Is he indeed the lord of such a shore? Other things have happened.","translation":"If mother comes to know of this pain-filled distress that makes my beautiful bangles slip off and faintness take over my body, will I survive, my friend? May you live! On the adjacent shore of mingled sand battered unceasingly by the mighty sea, girls playing the ōrai game together cause a crab they caught to suffer; but its fast-paced flight is aided by the high-rising, expanding waves that sweep it away to safety. Is he indeed the lord of such a shore? Things have turned out otherwise.","modern":"என் அழகான வளையல்கள் கழன்று விழவும், என் உடலைச் சோர்வு வந்து பற்றவும் காரணமான இந்த நோய் நிறைந்த துன்பத்தை என் தாய் அறிந்து கொண்டால், நான் உயிரோடு இருப்பேனா, தோழியே? நீ வாழ்க! வலிமையான கடல் அலைகள் வந்து மோதும் கலந்த மணலைக் கொண்ட கரையில், ஓரை விளையாட்டு விளையாடும் பெண்கள் ஒன்று சேர்ந்து, அங்கே அகப்பட்டுக் கொண்ட நண்டை வருத்துகிறார்கள். அந்த நண்டு துன்பப்பட்டு வேகமாக ஓடும்போது, உயர்ந்து வரும் விரிந்த அலைகள் அதனை அடித்துச் சென்று காப்பாற்றுகின்றன. இத்தகைய நெய்தல் நிலத் தலைவன் இரக்கமற்றவனாக இருக்கிறானே! நம் நிலைமை வேறு விதமாகிவிட்டதே!","explanation":"The heroine (தலைவி) is speaking to her confidante (தோழி) in this Neytal (coastal) landscape poem. She expresses her deep anguish over her secret love affair and the physical changes it has caused, such as her bangles slipping off and faintness overcoming her body. She fears that if her mother discovers her distress, she will not survive. The poem employs a beautiful metaphor (உள்ளுறை உவமம்) of the coastal landscape: girls playing on the shore torment a crab, but the rising waves of the sea rescue it. This image contrasts with the lord of the shore (தலைவன்), who, unlike the compassionate waves that save the suffering crab, remains indifferent to the heroine's suffering. The key words are 'ஆய்வளை' (beautiful bangles), 'அன்னை' (mother), 'அலவன்' (crab), and 'துறைவன்' (lord of the shore).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.79,1.13],[1.36,1.74],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,3.4],[3.4,3.5],[3.5,4.2],[4.26,4.6],[4.8,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.6],[5.6,6.52],[6.52,6.52],[6.52,6.52],[6.52,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,8.44],[8.44,8.44],[8.44,8.44],[8.44,8.44],[8.44,8.44],[8.44,8.6],[8.6,11.9],[11.9,12.4],[12.4,13.1],[13.1,13.68],[13.68,14.1],[14.1,15.0],[15.0,15.25],[15.25,15.65],[15.65,16.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.8,1.2],[1.3,1.77],[1.9,2.4],[2.4,3.7],[3.7,3.8],[3.8,4.5],[4.59,5.1],[5.25,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,8.8],[8.8,9.2],[9.2,10.0],[10.0,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,12.3],[12.3,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.2,13.7],[13.7,14.7],[14.7,15.05],[15.12,15.6],[15.82,16.9],[16.9,17.41],[17.54,17.8],[17.9,18.2]]}}